<title>GERMANY: Linde raises dividend as 96 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Linde raises dividend as 96 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   395.9 up 10.4 pct</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     689.1 up 11.1 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  8,801 up 6.2 pct</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 44.10 dmk up 10.3 pct</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    8,936 up 4 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend				     17.50 dmk vs 16 dmk</p>
<p>    Group investment			   1,109 vs 933</p>
<p>    Group workforce (headcount)	    30,746 vs 30,068</p>
<p>    --of which abroad			  13,569 vs 12,646</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German engineering group is Linde AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
